Upstream commit 303bf265280d07532972bf7eeca96dc100fd8d4c (2026-09-19) was
used for the provenance review on 2026-10-27. This is the reviewed reference
revision; this project's original import commit is not recorded. Files
adapted for TWX Analyzer v2 are under
src/main/java/io/twxav2/analysis/ref/{model,parse,rules,util}; additionally,
RefModel.java contains one reused method. These files carry source and
