Project-authored, non-derived components include the platform around the
analysis core: the Quarkus REST API, ingest/parser integration, MariaDB
persistence, React/Mantine frontend, direct BPM import, search, diagrams,
language switching, quality gate, exports, project-specific rule catalog
changes (including targeted false-positive fixes), and German rule-text
overlays (`ruletexts-de.properties`).

